--- Normal array concatenation ---
len(a1 + a2): 4
concat1[0]: 10
concat1[1]: 20
concat1[2]: 30
concat1[3]: 40
--- Array + String coercion ---
array + string: <array>hello
--- Nested array concatenation ---
len(nested_concat): 4
nested_concat[0]: 1
nested_concat[2]: 3
--- Empty array concatenation ---
len([] + [100, 200]): 2
res_empty[0]: 100
--- Non-array / Non-string addition to array ---
[1, 2] + nil: 0
[1, 2] + 5: 0
[1, 2] + true: 0
